  "description": "The META TR V4 RIDE is designed for efficiency and simplicity. Still, it remains fun and effective thanks to reliable, high-performing components.\n• The ROCKSHOX Revelation RC fork offers an excellent stiffness-to-weight ratio, with simple low-speed compression and rebound adjustments. A Charger 2.1 cartridge is available as an option. The Deluxe Select+ shock impresses with its ability to absorb hits without bottoming out. Both positive and negative air chambers are tunable for a precise setup.\n• SRAM provide the stopping power with the GUIDEs with 200mm rotors. This combo delivers precise and consistent braking.\n• The rims are E13 LG1, built on reinforced hubs. A particularly reliable setup.\n• The SRAM SX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain provides a 11-50 range, perfect for climbing.",
